From 969404981019661429c5430f5efbc452595a67df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 17:56:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Install Auto Glass Growth brand kit: AG mark, favicons,
 manifest, OG image, schema logo
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- public/brand/: mark (light + new dark variant with white A), logo SVG/PNG variants
- Root favicons (svg, 16, 32), apple-touch-icon, icon-192/512, og-image.png, site.webmanifest
- BrandMark component renders the AG mark (variant prop) beside the existing HTML wordmark
- BaseLayout: full favicon link set, manifest, theme-color, og:image → /og-image.png with
  width/height, Organization logo/image in schema
- Removed old ecosystem hero image; tidied duplicated .leaks__note rule

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YTqriFcoGbKf8UugCsc6PQ
